UID:TOXsfdt3Lx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nAfter years of slapdash sequels 
 and waning fandom\, the Camp Miasma slasher franchise is handed over to an
  enthusiastic young director for resurrection. But when she visits the ori
 ginal movie’s star\, a now-reclusive actress shrouded in mystery\, the t
 wo women fall into a blood-soaked world of desire\, fear\, and delirium. 
  Screenings presented in 35mm here.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/teenage-sex-and-death-at-camp-miasma\n\nEstimated start: 13:05
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
